\verb{vcov = "hetero", ssc = ssc(K.adj = FALSE, G.adj = FALSE)} and \code{"clustered"} is
\verb{vcov = ~cl, ssc = ssc(K.adj = FALSE, G.adj = FALSE)}. CRV3 is an error.
